# Agent-session scratch. `.claude/skills/` is tracked on purpose; these two are not.
# `tmp/` catches temp dirs a test opens through os.tmpdir() when a session points TMPDIR inside the
# checkout -- ask-admin-agent.test.ts mkdtemp's an `opzava-openclaw-bootstrap-*` there and writes a
# local-dev secrets file into it, which is untracked but stageable by a `git add -A`.
.claude/tmp/
.claude/worktrees/

# Model-flow / codex-exec runner artifacts — disposable, never committed
.model-flow/
